WEBVTT

00:22.760 --> 00:24.520
Hey, look at this.

00:29.840 --> 00:31.040
People said a while ago

00:31.120 --> 00:32.400
at the train station,

00:32.479 --> 00:34.120
there was a fashionable girl

00:34.200 --> 00:35.840
with Chen Maidong from the funeral parlor.

00:35.920 --> 00:37.520
They kissed passionately.

00:37.600 --> 00:38.560
Kissed…

00:39.160 --> 00:40.920
Do you even know
what a passionate kiss is?

00:41.000 --> 00:42.760
It's probably the girl who has no shame.

00:44.080 --> 00:45.520
Why do you care?

00:45.600 --> 00:47.240
They kissed. So what?

00:51.440 --> 00:52.320
Here.

00:53.200 --> 00:54.920
You say this
because you're not in my shoes.

00:55.000 --> 00:56.920
Zhuang Jie takes care of herself well.

00:57.000 --> 00:59.320
If Zhuang Jie dared to act crudely,

00:59.800 --> 01:01.560
getting tangled with some guy,

01:01.640 --> 01:03.280
kissing and touching in town,

01:03.360 --> 01:04.840
I won't even have to tell her fortune.

01:04.920 --> 01:06.200
I'll take her life myself!

01:22.160 --> 01:24.040
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

01:24.120 --> 01:25.080
Ms. Lin.

01:27.200 --> 01:28.080
Ms. Lin.

01:28.760 --> 01:30.840
It's me, Wu.

01:40.240 --> 01:42.040
-Ms. Lin.
-Why are you here this late at night?

01:42.120 --> 01:44.640
I'm sorry to disturb you so late.

01:45.400 --> 01:46.760
She has gone crazy too.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.960
Ms. Lin, what's wrong with you?

01:50.040 --> 01:51.840
-You are sweating.
-I'm fine.

01:53.440 --> 01:54.960
-Come in.
-Come in.

01:55.640 --> 01:56.800
Come on in.

01:57.960 --> 01:58.840
Ms. Lin.

02:00.160 --> 02:01.720
My daughter…

02:02.960 --> 02:03.880
I…

02:03.960 --> 02:05.880
I'm done for!

03:26.520 --> 03:31.320
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

04:02.680 --> 04:04.000
He Niaoniao,

04:04.080 --> 04:05.120
go back to your room.

04:05.200 --> 04:06.440
Don't be ungrateful.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.720
I'm warming up the bed for you.

04:08.960 --> 04:09.840
Where is Mom?

04:09.920 --> 04:10.920
Beats me.

04:11.680 --> 04:13.040
No one was home.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.120
I'm afraid.

04:17.640 --> 04:18.680
I want to sleep with you.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.680
All right.

04:25.880 --> 04:26.840
Little tyke.

04:29.800 --> 04:31.000
Go to sleep.

04:32.400 --> 04:33.720
I'll join you after washing up.

04:54.320 --> 04:55.680
ZHUANG JIE

04:55.760 --> 04:58.320
CHEN MAIDONG, I KNOW YOU ARE SERIOUS.

04:58.400 --> 05:00.560
HONESTLY, I'M IMPRESSED.

05:00.640 --> 05:02.680
AFTER SEEING THE OUTSIDE WORLD,

05:02.760 --> 05:05.160
YOU STILL CHOSE
TO RETURN AND STAY IN TOWN.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.880
BUT I CAN'T DO THAT.

05:06.960 --> 05:09.280
I HAVE MANY PURSUITS,
SO I CAN'T COME BACK.

05:09.360 --> 05:12.800
MAYBE MY INSECURITY URGES ME
TO EQUIP MYSELF WITH SUCCESS

05:12.880 --> 05:15.760
TO PROVE MY WORTH.

05:15.840 --> 05:21.880
SO COULD YOU PLEASE NOT
FORCE ME TO CHANGE?

05:51.840 --> 05:53.760
NO NEED TO CHANGE.
I ACCEPT WHO YOU ARE.

06:08.920 --> 06:09.840
No need to change.

06:10.880 --> 06:11.840
I accept who you are.

06:55.520 --> 06:57.240
Jie! Jie, get up!

06:57.320 --> 06:58.800
It's 8:30 a.m. I'm late!

06:59.800 --> 07:01.880
Where is Mom? Why didn't she wake us up?

07:01.960 --> 07:03.120
I don't know.

07:03.640 --> 07:04.960
It's quiet outside.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.560
Did Mom not come home last night?

07:10.800 --> 07:12.720
Madam Wu,
are you sure my mom is all right?

07:12.800 --> 07:14.400
Goodness, neither of you are youngsters

07:14.480 --> 07:15.720
who get drunk easily.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.680
Let her sleep in.

07:16.760 --> 07:18.040
I will mind the store today.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.120
Jie, bring me the chocolate.

07:20.200 --> 07:21.720
-Where is it?
-The coffee table.

07:22.880 --> 07:24.840
-Put it in my bag.
-I see why Mom gets annoyed.

07:24.920 --> 07:26.680
We have to be at your beck and call.

07:26.760 --> 07:27.960
And how about you?

07:28.040 --> 07:29.640
You make such a big fuss

07:29.720 --> 07:30.880
just to make awful toast.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.960
Don't eat so much chocolate.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.120
Look at your belly.

07:34.200 --> 07:35.720
I don't get to eat that.

07:35.800 --> 07:38.080
-It's a New Year's gift for my classmate.
-For a classmate?

07:38.160 --> 07:40.320
Price isn't important,
but it's the thought that counts.

07:40.400 --> 07:41.880
You clearly got it from a supermarket.

07:41.960 --> 07:42.920
Everyone gives gifts.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.720
I have to follow suit.

07:44.800 --> 07:46.120
If not, I will be isolated again.

07:46.200 --> 07:48.080
He Niaoniao, don't talk nonsense.

07:48.160 --> 07:50.520
I've met your teacher.
You're likely the one isolating others.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.400
You don't understand. I'm too pretty.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.960
Girls in my class don't like me.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.960
It's impossible to be liked by everyone.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.120
Improve your grades.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.480
I will prepare a new gift for you.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.720
My sister is the best.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.000
Unlike Mom.

08:09.080 --> 08:10.680
She doesn't care about me.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.920
She never replies to messages
in the class group chat.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.800
That's why I can't be the class rep.

08:15.400 --> 08:17.240
When she comes back later,
I'm going to tell Mom

08:17.320 --> 08:19.120
to fix your unhealthy thinking.

08:19.200 --> 08:20.120
Hurry and go.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.080
Wait.

08:27.000 --> 08:28.000
Bye.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.280
Here.

08:42.400 --> 08:43.440
Eat some.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.360
I don't want to.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.360
Look at you.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.160
Do you have to be so angry?

08:49.240 --> 08:51.120
It's normal for Jie to be dating

08:51.200 --> 08:52.280
at her age.

08:52.960 --> 08:55.360
It depends on who the man she is seeing.

08:56.280 --> 08:58.680
Chen Maidong is a pretty good guy.

08:58.760 --> 09:00.720
Yes, he's pretty good as a neighbor.

09:03.480 --> 09:04.720
When Zhangyue passed away,

09:04.800 --> 09:06.240
I was really grateful to him.

09:07.640 --> 09:10.000
But this is a different matter.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.560
When it comes to being a son-in-law,

09:12.200 --> 09:13.920
his family background matters here.

09:15.240 --> 09:16.720
Is his family decent?

09:16.800 --> 09:19.200
Chen Maidong is young and talented.

09:20.520 --> 09:23.080
His dad has been doing business
in the province for years.

09:23.160 --> 09:25.200
His family is very well-off.

09:25.280 --> 09:26.240
I'm not after his money!

09:29.080 --> 09:29.960
His grandma

09:30.040 --> 09:32.200
broke into someone's yard with a sickle.

09:32.280 --> 09:34.960
When I think about it now,
I still get the jitters.

09:35.040 --> 09:38.080
If something goes wrong in the future,

09:38.160 --> 09:39.880
she might come after me and my daughter.

09:41.000 --> 09:42.200
Besides,

09:42.280 --> 09:44.040
my own family has been through a lot.

09:44.120 --> 09:46.640
Chen Maidong's family
isn't complete either.

09:46.720 --> 09:48.800
What good can come
from them being together?

09:48.880 --> 09:52.120
Zhuang Jie keeps saying
that she wants to go back to Shanghai.

09:52.200 --> 09:53.120
Yet now,

09:53.200 --> 09:55.120
she did such an indecent thing in public.

09:55.760 --> 09:57.760
-What exactly does she want?
-Here.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.400
You are to blame too.

09:59.480 --> 10:01.960
You always claim
to find Chen Maidong a match.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.720
Don't you know how they got together?

10:04.800 --> 10:07.400
They were classmates in high school.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.400
You are her mom,

10:08.480 --> 10:09.800
and you are clueless about it.

10:09.880 --> 10:10.880
So how would I know?

10:14.480 --> 10:15.440
In my opinion,

10:15.520 --> 10:19.360
you should turn a blind eye to them.

10:20.680 --> 10:21.800
Honestly,

10:21.880 --> 10:24.160
I think Chen Maidong
truly likes Zhuang Jie.

10:24.800 --> 10:28.640
His grandma forced me
to introduce so many girls to him.

10:28.720 --> 10:30.080
Those girls agreed,

10:30.640 --> 10:31.720
but Chen Maidong

10:31.800 --> 10:33.040
didn't meet any of them.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.320
It's true. I'm not lying.

10:34.400 --> 10:36.080
And that's the problem.

10:36.160 --> 10:38.400
Both he and his grandma
are so fickle-minded.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.120
I know how hard it has been for you

10:40.200 --> 10:41.320
to be caught in the middle.

10:42.040 --> 10:43.400
Neither of them has a clear mind.

10:43.480 --> 10:45.480
Why must Zhuang Jie get involved in this?

10:45.560 --> 10:47.080
Is she even in her right mind?

10:47.680 --> 10:50.160
I used to think
she was smart and ambitious.

10:50.240 --> 10:52.520
At least find a man
who is physically and mentally healthy.

10:52.600 --> 10:54.600
That's not him.

10:54.680 --> 10:56.000
I can't believe her.

10:56.080 --> 10:58.280
Look, we are moms.

10:58.360 --> 11:00.160
I can relate to your feelings.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.360
Even though we all live in the same town,

11:03.200 --> 11:05.840
we don't know much

11:05.920 --> 11:07.360
about the Chen family.

11:07.440 --> 11:09.480
Back then, when her son got divorced,

11:09.560 --> 11:11.720
it had caused quite a stir in the town.

11:11.800 --> 11:12.640
But now,

11:12.720 --> 11:14.440
nobody knows what actually happened.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.360
Chen Maidong

11:16.440 --> 11:17.960
may seem decent now,

11:18.040 --> 11:19.400
but he got into fights as a kid.

11:20.040 --> 11:22.400
He had a girlfriend
for six or seven years.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.880
They should have gotten married,

11:23.960 --> 11:25.440
but they broke up.

11:25.520 --> 11:26.560
I don't know what happened.

11:26.640 --> 11:28.320
Hurry up and tell Zhuang Jie

11:28.400 --> 11:29.360
what you just told me.

11:30.040 --> 11:30.960
Goodness.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.720
My own daughter won't listen to me.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.120
Do you think your daughter will?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.200
Chen Maidong,

11:47.280 --> 11:49.960
I knew you were the right person
to go to prepare gifts.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.160
You are so skilled.

11:51.760 --> 11:52.680
Only if it were true.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.440
You, on the other hand, have impressed me.

11:56.440 --> 11:58.040
I thought you only had a leg problem,

11:58.120 --> 12:00.040
but it seems your hands are useless too.

12:01.040 --> 12:03.640
Stop it. Did you forget
what happened the last time you kicked me?

12:06.680 --> 12:07.760
Chen Maidong,

12:07.840 --> 12:09.040
I have prepared a gift for you.

12:11.760 --> 12:12.680
Your reward.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.600
No, thanks.

12:14.680 --> 12:16.280
You must've stolen it from your sister.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.280
Nonsense.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.640
I picked this out just for you.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.600
It's delicious.

12:19.680 --> 12:21.200
Here. Try it.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.480
Later.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.720
Have a look.

12:25.800 --> 12:26.680
How is it?

12:29.080 --> 12:30.040
Nice.

12:33.480 --> 12:35.240
I think something is missing here.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.600
This is a gift for a kid.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.920
Maybe I will add some decoration.

12:47.400 --> 12:48.240
Perfect.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.120
I can reuse it.

12:55.560 --> 12:58.640
Chen Maidong,
you have a lot of knickknacks.

13:01.640 --> 13:02.880
You wouldn't buy these.

13:04.160 --> 13:05.480
Did someone give you these?

13:06.800 --> 13:08.800
My ex-girlfriend liked to give gifts.

13:11.000 --> 13:12.520
You kept them all.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.880
Do you mind?

13:15.800 --> 13:17.040
Not at all.

13:17.120 --> 13:18.320
I couldn't be more grateful

13:18.400 --> 13:19.560
that you are helping me out.

13:21.280 --> 13:22.640
Besides,

13:22.720 --> 13:23.680
you are a grown-up.

13:23.760 --> 13:25.560
Why wouldn't you have an ex?

13:26.160 --> 13:27.080
No flirting.

13:27.880 --> 13:28.840
If you are bored,

13:29.320 --> 13:30.480
we can do something else.

13:36.640 --> 13:37.520
Chen Maidong,

13:38.760 --> 13:42.680
the time we can spend together is limited.

13:43.240 --> 13:44.400
I wouldn't waste it

13:44.480 --> 13:45.520
throwing a tantrum at you

13:45.600 --> 13:46.880
over trivial things.

13:48.160 --> 13:50.240
Have you decided
when you're returning to Shanghai?

13:51.360 --> 13:52.240
After the New Year.

14:00.600 --> 14:01.600
We promised

14:02.080 --> 14:03.400
that when we are together,

14:03.480 --> 14:06.480
you can't hide anything
from me or lie to me.

14:06.560 --> 14:07.480
All right?

14:09.880 --> 14:10.800
Sure.

14:11.440 --> 14:13.000
You should do the same too.

14:17.160 --> 14:20.040
I think Ms. Lin's view on love

14:20.120 --> 14:21.040
is an ideal model.

14:22.240 --> 14:23.480
We were in love,

14:23.560 --> 14:24.760
so there are no regrets.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.640
He has been in my heart

14:26.720 --> 14:28.320
for my whole life already.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.120
That's fair for both of us.

14:30.760 --> 14:31.600
That's nice.

14:34.160 --> 14:35.280
From what I know,

14:36.240 --> 14:37.840
she stayed single all her life.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.720
You don't understand.

14:40.960 --> 14:43.280
One can manage
to live their whole life alone

14:44.360 --> 14:46.880
because they hold
their most precious memories deep inside.

14:46.960 --> 14:48.040
That's why they are at ease.

14:48.800 --> 14:50.200
When they are in love,

14:50.280 --> 14:52.000
they don't hold back their passion.

14:52.800 --> 14:54.960
When they lose each other,
they stay strong and move on.

14:55.040 --> 14:56.440
That makes their lives worthwhile.

15:00.080 --> 15:01.840
If a lasting relationship were possible,

15:02.720 --> 15:04.120
no one would choose to be alone.

15:12.600 --> 15:13.640
Chen Maidong,

15:15.800 --> 15:18.400
there is something I must tell you.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.840
It's about Ms. Lin.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.680
Okay.

15:21.760 --> 15:24.520
You were hemming and hawing
on the phone last time.

15:24.600 --> 15:26.000
It is not good news.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.680
I'm home.

15:49.040 --> 15:50.440
Jie, did someone buy you flowers?

15:50.520 --> 15:51.520
Focus on your homework.

15:52.560 --> 15:53.640
He Niaoniao,

15:53.720 --> 15:55.160
give this to your classmate tomorrow.

15:58.160 --> 15:59.000
Mom,

15:59.080 --> 16:00.240
wash some cherries.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.400
This is your favorite.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.640
I will do it.

16:02.720 --> 16:03.720
Mom has caught a cold.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.120
Cold?

16:06.200 --> 16:07.160
What has happened?

16:08.120 --> 16:09.240
Stop mopping. Let me do it.

16:09.320 --> 16:10.760
-Give it to me.
-Take a seat.

16:11.720 --> 16:14.800
Wait. Weren't you and Madam Wu
having a happy time last night?

16:14.880 --> 16:16.200
How come you fell sick?

16:19.800 --> 16:21.320
Don't use language I can't understand.

16:22.520 --> 16:23.800
Those cherries are expensive.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.320
You bought a whole box. Are you rich?

16:26.120 --> 16:27.120
It is a gift.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.200
Mom.

16:29.920 --> 16:30.800
Here.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.680
Mom, try this.

16:37.760 --> 16:39.640
-Try it.
-Come on, have a taste.

16:44.800 --> 16:45.680
Is it sweet?

16:50.240 --> 16:52.240
Mom, why are you eating so little?

16:52.320 --> 16:53.440
I didn't pay for it.

16:53.520 --> 16:55.400
You can't waste it,
no matter whose money it is.

16:56.120 --> 16:58.120
Don't take advantage of others.

16:58.200 --> 16:59.520
Your words sound so wrong to me.

17:00.560 --> 17:02.240
Besides, I've always been poor.

17:02.320 --> 17:03.360
I'm a cheapskate.

17:03.440 --> 17:04.720
Does it bother you?

17:04.800 --> 17:06.440
You have great taste and high standards.

17:06.520 --> 17:08.480
How can you be bought off
with a box of cherries?

17:08.560 --> 17:10.880
Go ahead and marry a rich and decent man.

17:11.760 --> 17:13.839
You get carried away so easily.

17:17.359 --> 17:19.720
If you have nothing else to do,
hurry and return to Shanghai.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.440
Stop showing your face in front of me.

17:27.720 --> 17:29.120
What's wrong with Mom?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.280
Before you came back,

17:30.360 --> 17:31.440
I thought I was the problem.

17:31.520 --> 17:33.240
But now it seems like it's you.

17:33.320 --> 17:34.200
I'm safe now.

17:43.280 --> 17:44.480
I was about to pick you up.

17:44.560 --> 17:46.240
You didn't answer my call again.

17:46.800 --> 17:48.280
How many times do I have to tell you

17:48.360 --> 17:49.520
that I know this road well?

17:49.600 --> 17:50.560
I won't get lost.

17:51.160 --> 17:53.120
Did you go to Ms. Lin for a chat?

17:53.200 --> 17:54.400
Yes.

17:54.480 --> 17:56.200
Aside from her,

17:56.280 --> 17:57.800
who would give me these fine things?

18:10.000 --> 18:11.240
Didn't you ask Ms. Lin

18:11.320 --> 18:13.320
why she gave you these?

18:13.400 --> 18:15.280
It's not the first time.

18:15.360 --> 18:17.960
Everything I have eaten
and worn these years

18:18.040 --> 18:19.320
were all given by her.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.880
Well,

18:23.560 --> 18:25.360
at least you have a grandson.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.600
Ms. Lin is all alone.

18:27.280 --> 18:28.600
You don't give anything in return,

18:28.680 --> 18:30.280
and you always take things from her.

18:31.280 --> 18:33.000
We have a fair exchange.

18:33.560 --> 18:35.600
She sincerely gives,

18:35.680 --> 18:37.520
and I gratefully receive.

18:37.600 --> 18:38.720
We are happy.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.640
The New Year is coming after Christmas.

18:43.160 --> 18:45.240
Did you give Jie anything?

18:45.320 --> 18:46.840
Yes, I gave her cherries.

18:46.920 --> 18:47.840
Boring.

18:48.840 --> 18:50.080
She doesn't want anything else.

18:56.600 --> 18:57.560
Grandma,

18:58.440 --> 18:59.320
well,

19:00.360 --> 19:01.640
did Ms. Lin--

19:01.720 --> 19:04.720
Why are you so concerned
about us two old ladies?

19:05.240 --> 19:06.480
Don't worry about us.

19:07.120 --> 19:09.440
The priority now

19:09.520 --> 19:10.800
is you and Jie.

19:11.400 --> 19:13.600
I have been using this bracelet

19:13.680 --> 19:14.720
as prayer beads.

19:15.280 --> 19:16.440
Don't be ungrateful.

19:18.320 --> 19:19.600
We are doing quite well.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.840
A good start isn't enough.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.400
When you were with that vixen…

19:25.120 --> 19:26.840
I mean, Song Yi,

19:27.560 --> 19:29.440
it was a waste of time.

19:29.520 --> 19:31.080
She even abandoned you in the end.

19:32.440 --> 19:33.480
Maidong,

19:33.560 --> 19:37.360
I know why you chose to stay in Nanping.

19:37.440 --> 19:40.680
At first, it was to fill in
for your master's position.

19:41.600 --> 19:44.720
But now,
there are more staff in your unit.

19:45.880 --> 19:47.680
You don't have to trap yourself here.

19:48.680 --> 19:50.240
If you truly like Jie,

19:51.240 --> 19:52.320
go to Shanghai with her.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.760
I'm serious.

19:59.280 --> 20:01.200
Jie is a good woman
who is hard to come by.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.880
Even if you take her family name,

20:03.960 --> 20:04.880
I wouldn't mind.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.920
I have never thought of that.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.920
Besides, you are getting up in years.

20:13.720 --> 20:14.800
I will stay

20:16.040 --> 20:16.960
where you stay.

20:18.560 --> 20:20.320
I'm already at this age.

20:20.400 --> 20:22.080
I can live just about anywhere.

20:23.080 --> 20:24.160
I go

20:25.080 --> 20:26.440
where you go.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.120
Can you bear

20:33.720 --> 20:35.360
to leave Ms. Lin alone?

20:37.240 --> 20:38.400
Honestly,

20:39.520 --> 20:41.440
I have been thinking about this
for a long time.

20:42.200 --> 20:44.480
Ms. Lin is an understanding person.

20:47.280 --> 20:48.320
If it comes to it,

20:48.400 --> 20:50.600
I can come back more often every year.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.760
It is very convenient
to travel by plane or train.

20:52.840 --> 20:54.760
It's not like we won't
see each other again.

20:57.760 --> 20:58.640
Grandma,

21:00.800 --> 21:01.880
there is something--

21:04.000 --> 21:04.920
I have a call.

21:09.080 --> 21:10.200
Hello?

21:11.600 --> 21:12.440
What?

21:12.520 --> 21:13.440
I will be on my way.

21:16.600 --> 21:21.000
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

21:21.080 --> 21:25.080
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

21:27.560 --> 21:28.400
Ma'am.

21:31.120 --> 21:32.520
What would you like?

21:33.080 --> 21:35.200
What is the bestseller here?

21:35.960 --> 21:38.800
If it's for yourself, the whole chicken
or chicken wings are good choices.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.800
If it is a gift,

21:39.880 --> 21:41.640
you can get the Vacuum Chicken gift box.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.480
Give me two gift boxes

21:43.560 --> 21:44.600
with pretty packaging.

21:44.680 --> 21:46.160
Sure, I will choose it for you.

21:49.280 --> 21:50.600
Aren't you Song Yi?

21:50.680 --> 21:52.520
It has been years since I last saw you.

21:53.920 --> 21:55.840
Ma'am, it has been a long time.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.600
I don't live in Nanping anymore.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.480
Getting married
and moving to the city is good.

22:00.320 --> 22:02.320
What's up?
Did you come back to see Maidong?

22:02.400 --> 22:04.000
I'm going to visit his grandma.

22:04.080 --> 22:05.240
You should come back often.

22:05.800 --> 22:07.000
The old folks

22:07.080 --> 22:08.400
still talk about you.

22:11.640 --> 22:12.680
Here you go.

22:14.400 --> 22:15.360
You bought a lot.

22:15.440 --> 22:16.360
Scan here.

22:20.240 --> 22:21.200
Thank you, ma'am.

22:31.360 --> 22:33.240
Liao, do you know her?

22:37.240 --> 22:38.640
It seems that Song Yi

22:38.720 --> 22:39.960
is doing quite well.

22:41.040 --> 22:44.040
She wasn't like this
when she was dating Chen Maidong.

22:44.120 --> 22:45.200
Mrs. Chen had her

22:45.280 --> 22:47.240
wrapped around her finger.

22:47.320 --> 22:48.520
But she doesn't blame her.

22:48.600 --> 22:51.240
She is still close with them now.

22:54.120 --> 22:55.480
I haven't bought anything yet.

22:55.560 --> 22:56.800
I'm closing. Come another day.

22:56.880 --> 22:58.080
Seriously?

23:17.040 --> 23:17.960
Niaoniao!

23:19.000 --> 23:21.520
-Mom, I just picked Zhuang Yan up.
-Yan, you're finally back!

23:23.280 --> 23:25.640
We are going for a meal together.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.280
All right, got it.

23:29.920 --> 23:30.880
You're so impatient.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.360
Hey, the two of you.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.600
It was only a few days.
Don't be so dramatic.

23:38.680 --> 23:41.200
Jie, take us to eat something good.

23:41.280 --> 23:42.280
Mom wants to see me now.

23:42.360 --> 23:43.520
You guys go first.

23:43.600 --> 23:44.480
It's on me.

23:45.520 --> 23:47.080
I have a hunch that it can't be good.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.400
Good luck!

23:50.440 --> 23:51.760
What's wrong with Mom and Jie?

23:53.000 --> 23:53.840
Don't ask.

23:54.560 --> 23:56.640
Just tuck your tail between your legs.

24:01.840 --> 24:03.360
An Americano, thanks.

24:07.080 --> 24:09.720
Ms. Liao, you match the vibe
of the coffee house quite well.

24:17.080 --> 24:18.000
Look here.

24:24.120 --> 24:26.120
What's the big matter
that you chose to meet here?

24:29.760 --> 24:31.840
Do you find everything I do to be funny?

24:33.200 --> 24:34.720
Why are you so touchy?

24:34.800 --> 24:35.920
What have I done?

24:40.080 --> 24:43.480
Is it about Zhuang Yan or He Niaoniao?

24:43.560 --> 24:45.360
What's your relationship
with Chen Maidong?

24:49.400 --> 24:50.520
We're dating.

24:50.600 --> 24:51.600
When will you get married?

24:51.680 --> 24:53.080
Wait, what are you talking about?

24:53.160 --> 24:55.000
Who says dating must lead to marriage?

24:55.080 --> 24:56.800
Then what are you doing? Playing around?

24:56.880 --> 25:00.000
Mom, I can't control who I like.

25:00.080 --> 25:01.080
You like him.

25:01.160 --> 25:02.320
Does he like you?

25:02.400 --> 25:03.280
Of course.

25:03.360 --> 25:06.960
We both agreed to enjoy our time

25:07.440 --> 25:08.760
while we are still together.

25:08.840 --> 25:10.480
I'm still leaving after the New Year.

25:10.560 --> 25:12.400
Are you saying
that you kiss and hug causally

25:12.480 --> 25:13.920
and then just separate afterward?

25:14.000 --> 25:15.800
I'm telling you, Zhuang Jie,

25:15.880 --> 25:17.600
I've suffered a lot
because I'm uneducated,

25:17.680 --> 25:19.160
but I understand life better than you.

25:19.240 --> 25:21.360
Don't think for a second
you can walk all over me

25:21.440 --> 25:23.120
because you are well-educated.

25:23.680 --> 25:26.160
I despise it to the bone when you all rant

25:26.240 --> 25:28.880
about open-mindedness, freedom,

25:28.960 --> 25:30.080
free will, or whatever.

25:31.200 --> 25:33.160
Even if the whole world buys it, I won't.

25:33.880 --> 25:36.000
Our family
are simple and honest townsfolk.

25:36.080 --> 25:37.160
As long as you are here,

25:37.240 --> 25:38.480
you have to follow the rules.

25:39.200 --> 25:41.200
Don't you ever humiliate us

25:41.280 --> 25:43.360
and let anyone talk
behind Mr. He's and my back.

25:54.120 --> 25:55.360
Mom,

25:55.440 --> 25:56.520
this is too much.

25:56.600 --> 25:57.480
Too much?

25:58.120 --> 25:59.640
I'm holding back what I want to say.

26:00.840 --> 26:02.440
-Break up with him.
-Impossible.

26:03.640 --> 26:06.280
Do you want me
to lay the ugly truth bare for you?

26:06.760 --> 26:10.040
You will be the only victim in this fling.

26:10.120 --> 26:13.640
Why are women always the victim
when the relationship is consensual?

26:13.720 --> 26:15.160
It's feudalism at its worst.

26:16.000 --> 26:18.400
Let me tell you what is really the worst.

26:18.480 --> 26:20.080
A moment's pleasure leads to pregnancy

26:20.160 --> 26:21.240
and a lifetime of regret.

26:21.320 --> 26:22.240
Is this what you want?

26:22.320 --> 26:23.960
Keep it down. There are people here.

26:24.040 --> 26:25.520
What are you making us out to be?

26:25.600 --> 26:27.120
Tell me, what are you two?

26:27.840 --> 26:30.240
He won't respect you
if you don't respect yourself.

26:30.800 --> 26:33.320
Seeing your current conduct,
I doubt you will be cherished.

26:33.400 --> 26:34.760
Chen Maidong isn't like that.

26:34.840 --> 26:35.720
As if.

26:36.280 --> 26:38.440
How would you know?
How long have you known him?

26:38.520 --> 26:39.360
I just do.

26:39.440 --> 26:41.240
Do you also know his ex-girlfriend came?

26:46.120 --> 26:47.640
Good swimmers are the ones who drown.

26:48.760 --> 26:50.520
Experienced drivers
are the ones who crash.

26:51.600 --> 26:54.240
Those who think they are smart
are the easy targets.

27:27.840 --> 27:29.360
What is this? It's so bitter.

27:29.440 --> 27:31.200
It tastes like herbal medicine.

27:38.840 --> 27:40.040
Mrs. Chen.

27:40.120 --> 27:41.200
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

27:41.840 --> 27:43.680
Are you throwing the chicken away?

27:44.160 --> 27:45.760
It's not about the chicken.

27:45.840 --> 27:47.440
It's about who gave them.

27:48.240 --> 27:49.160
Who was it?

27:51.520 --> 27:53.080
It's fine, Mrs. Chen.

27:53.160 --> 27:54.840
It's all right if you can't tell.

27:56.560 --> 27:58.040
Is Chen Maidong not home?

27:58.520 --> 28:00.000
He left in a hurry last night.

28:00.840 --> 28:02.800
Something must have come up at work.

28:04.400 --> 28:06.160
Well, I'm going to go, Mrs. Chen.

28:06.240 --> 28:08.160
Jie, look,

28:08.240 --> 28:10.080
there is no secret between you and me.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.680
Song Yi came here just now.

28:13.880 --> 28:15.920
I know. Chen Maidong's ex-girlfriend.

28:16.480 --> 28:17.680
What ex-girlfriend?

28:17.760 --> 28:19.360
She is a troublemaker.

28:19.920 --> 28:22.320
If Maidong had never met her,

28:22.400 --> 28:24.200
he would be much better off.

28:24.840 --> 28:26.080
He's doing quite well now.

28:26.760 --> 28:27.960
It has been so long.

28:28.040 --> 28:29.440
Chen Maidong doesn't care.

28:29.520 --> 28:31.760
That's because he's silly.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.680
If it weren't for that girl,

28:33.760 --> 28:35.520
he wouldn't be so traumatized.

28:36.880 --> 28:37.880
And in the end,

28:38.440 --> 28:40.280
she cheated on him.

28:42.440 --> 28:44.440
Why is she back now?

28:45.400 --> 28:47.600
She is living a wonderful life.

28:47.680 --> 28:49.800
She said she came here
for the new seaside resort,

28:49.880 --> 28:51.800
so she dropped by to visit us.

28:51.880 --> 28:52.960
I don't need that.

28:53.680 --> 28:55.400
I'm not as kind and soft

28:56.040 --> 28:57.440
as Chen Maidong

28:57.520 --> 28:59.200
who becomes at a loss

28:59.280 --> 29:01.680
when he sees her crying pitifully.

29:01.760 --> 29:02.920
Maidong always gets distracted

29:03.000 --> 29:04.880
for days after seeing her.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.560
No, it's not like that.

29:08.640 --> 29:11.720
Jie, Maidong cares about you.

29:11.800 --> 29:13.320
Nothing will happen between them.

29:14.120 --> 29:15.400
I'm just angry

29:15.480 --> 29:16.440
about her.

29:17.880 --> 29:18.800
All right.

29:18.880 --> 29:20.200
Anger is bad for your health.

29:21.000 --> 29:22.680
Mrs. Chen, I have to go.

29:22.760 --> 29:23.880
I will visit you another day.

29:25.400 --> 29:26.360
Jie.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.920
I was just venting.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.120
Don't take it to heart.

29:33.560 --> 29:34.400
I won't.

30:29.600 --> 30:30.640
Excuse me.

30:30.720 --> 30:33.000
You are not here for business, right?

30:34.240 --> 30:36.160
Hello. I'm waiting for Chen Maidong.

30:36.240 --> 30:38.040
Do you know when he will be free?

30:38.120 --> 30:41.040
Maidong went to the seaside resort.

30:42.600 --> 30:44.800
Did he go there for work?

30:44.880 --> 30:46.080
I guess so.

30:46.160 --> 30:48.520
But technically,

30:48.600 --> 30:49.880
he doesn't have shifts today.

30:57.160 --> 30:59.480
Chen Maidong, we promised
to be frank with each other.

30:59.560 --> 31:02.080
Tell me if you are meeting someone,
and all will be fine.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.680
If you dare to lie to me,

31:04.560 --> 31:05.840
just you wait.

31:08.840 --> 31:10.840
Ms. Zhang, it's me, Zhuang Jie.

31:11.880 --> 31:14.160
I want to ask
if you still work as a janitor

31:14.240 --> 31:15.760
at the seaside resort's guesthouse.

31:15.840 --> 31:16.720
Yes.

31:18.240 --> 31:20.960
Have you seen a guest
named Song Yi these two days?

31:21.440 --> 31:22.960
Do you know her?

31:26.200 --> 31:28.320
Two people?

31:29.000 --> 31:31.560
All right, got it. Thank you.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.480
-Wang Xixia.
-Go on.

31:56.560 --> 31:57.960
Have I told you

31:58.040 --> 32:00.920
how much I hate dramatic cheating scenes?

32:04.080 --> 32:05.960
What's this about?
I'm training the new recruits.

32:06.040 --> 32:07.080
Nothing.

32:07.160 --> 32:09.600
I just hate finding out
that I'm just like everybody else.

32:09.680 --> 32:12.040
I think I don't know Chen Maidong at all.

32:14.320 --> 32:15.720
You are just overthinking.

32:15.800 --> 32:17.560
Misunderstandings will drive you two apart

32:17.640 --> 32:18.560
if it's left unsolved.

32:19.520 --> 32:21.480
Still, Chen Maidong's character

32:21.560 --> 32:22.600
is guaranteed.

32:23.400 --> 32:25.040
Don't behave like a gangster.

32:29.960 --> 32:30.880
Zhuang Jie.

32:32.680 --> 32:33.560
Zhuang Jie?

32:35.200 --> 32:36.120
Zhuang Jie?

32:47.000 --> 32:47.880
Where was I?

32:47.960 --> 32:50.360
You said that salespeople
must act like robbers sometimes.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.800
Right, and not only that,

32:52.360 --> 32:54.400
but sometimes, you also need to be bold

32:54.480 --> 32:55.440
and wild.

32:59.080 --> 33:00.440
But you said earlier,

33:00.520 --> 33:02.320
we need to be sincere.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.640
Does sincerity contradict these?

33:04.320 --> 33:05.680
Let me add something.

33:05.760 --> 33:07.000
Salespeople should never

33:07.080 --> 33:08.520
cut off the customer mid-sentence.

33:09.080 --> 33:11.240
Why are you looking at me? Note it down.

33:14.200 --> 33:18.320
ZIGUI

33:31.680 --> 33:33.120
Who are you?

33:33.200 --> 33:34.480
Are you Song Yi?

33:35.600 --> 33:36.560
Yes, I am.

33:37.360 --> 33:38.560
Who are you looking for?

33:44.840 --> 33:45.680
Are you pregnant?

33:47.560 --> 33:48.720
Are you married?

33:48.800 --> 33:49.760
Hey.

33:49.840 --> 33:52.320
Who are you? What is it to you?

33:56.800 --> 33:58.560
I'm sorry. I'm Zhuang Jie.

34:09.560 --> 34:11.040
-Here's your coffee.
-Thank you.

34:11.120 --> 34:12.040
You're welcome.

34:21.600 --> 34:23.400
I'm sorry about earlier.

34:23.960 --> 34:26.159
I was a bit moody before I came.

34:26.679 --> 34:28.000
That's why I was rude.

34:30.080 --> 34:31.000
It's fine.

34:31.600 --> 34:33.120
Maidong told me about you before.

34:33.760 --> 34:36.320
I was hoping to meet you.

34:36.800 --> 34:38.520
Is Chen Maidong that talkative?

34:40.920 --> 34:42.080
As you know,

34:42.159 --> 34:43.239
he is reticent.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.360
After I met my husband,

34:45.440 --> 34:47.320
Maidong and I barely stayed in touch.

34:50.960 --> 34:53.639
So I believe he told me about you

34:54.280 --> 34:55.880
because you are important

34:57.160 --> 34:58.240
and

34:59.760 --> 35:00.840
he wanted me

35:00.920 --> 35:01.960
to feel less guilty.

35:05.960 --> 35:06.920
Guilty?

35:08.240 --> 35:09.120
Yes.

35:11.520 --> 35:13.840
Maidong and I dated for seven years.

35:14.960 --> 35:16.800
It wasn't because we were deeply in love.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.600
It was out of guilt.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.560
My brother is Song Ran,

35:25.080 --> 35:26.480
Chen Maidong's best friend.

37:39.720 --> 37:46.280
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
